~ start
if QuestService.is_completed_offered()
	=> completed
elif QuestService.is_ready_offered()
	=> ready
elif QuestService.is_accepted_offered()
	=> in_progress
else
	Giver: Speak with me again after you accept, then I can close the greeting.
	- I will greet you.
		do QuestService.request_accept_offered()
		=> END
	=> END

~ in_progress
Giver: That is the talk I needed.
=> END

~ ready
Giver: I can take the greeting now.
- Turn it in.
	do QuestService.request_turn_in_offered()
	=> END

~ completed
Giver: The platform greeting is done.
=> END
